<title>UK: London fertiliser fixtures.</title>
<headline>London fertiliser fixtures.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pertishta - 30,000 tonnes urea Jubail/India $13.50 fio 4,500/1,200 15-19/5 Indian Government.</p>
<p>Hakkia Maru - 12,500 tonnes urea Marsa el Brega/India $31.50 fio 6,000/1,200 4-6/5 Indian Government.</p>
<p>Aurora - 15,000 tonnes ammonia-nitrate St.</p>
<p>Petersburg/Argentina $31 fio 2,500/1,500 Intracom.</p>
